{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の『月刊Songs』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載ってます～！\nゆったんと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアルバムについて\nだけど\nより深くお話してきたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/05/16/6055143/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nママとご飯行ったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はお休みが多くて\n先週は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日夜は琴子とご飯\n火曜日夜はバトン部の友達とご飯\n木曜日昼は寧々と映画\n木曜日夜は中高の友達とご飯\n金曜日昼は中高の友達とご飯\n日曜日は元スタッフさんと水族館"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々は\n本当に久々に会ったの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ話せて楽しかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん、写メとか撮ってなくて（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう１週間もあり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の\nNOGIBINGO!8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再び出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまとみなみとだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}